: {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "4.11.1"}, "id": {"label": "10443851472"}, "title": {"label": "Good game"}, "content": {"label": "Good game", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id240735068"}, "name": {"label": ">>V1P3R<<"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-09-10T10:18:28-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "4.10.0"}, "id": {"label": "10354765722"}, "title": {"label": "Great game but too expensive"}, "content": {"label": "Awesome gaming experience but few complaints:\n\n1. Winning a battle gets you 5k points but an aircraft costs 5 million points which basically forces you to use real money for purchases. I understand you are running business but this is difference is absurd.\n\n2. You cannot sell previously purchased aircraft and use that earning to buy new one. I mean c\u2019mon, who uses an older aircraft once you have purchased a new one? Most simulation games give this option to resell. \n\n3. I believe you are biased towards the F series aircrafts. Even within the same tier, the F series always performs better in the game.\n\n4. If due to some glitch you get disconnected during a battle, then the fuel and earnings of that battle is lost. That\u2019s not good.\n\n5. Pls provide an offline mode so that we can enjoy this game during travel.\n\n6. Lot of times you are matched against an aircraft of a much higher tier. Then the battle becomes one sided and leads to frustration and loss of interest.\n\nGiving 2 stars because of above issues, otherwise kudos to the team for developing this great game.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "2"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "2"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id554056026"}, "name": {"label": "Thizzotron"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-08-26T21:27:37-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "4.9.0"}, "id": {"label": "10303561783"}, "title": {"label": "No money no win"}, "content": {"label": "Probably one of the best fighter aircraft games here but , you get the best experience only when you spend . Otherwise you just end up becoming cannon fodder for the ones who do spend on the game. So my best advise will be to stay far away from this one !", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1437729726"}, "name": {"label": "OmkarSagare"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-07-17T21:59:46-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "4.6.0"}, "id": {"label": "10152759169"}, "title": {"label": "Issues with new update"}, "content": {"label": "Facing issues after new update. Not able to start battle", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1546220256"}, "name": {"label": "Sushant khalde"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-07-06T22:46:29-07: