takes up 2 fuel slots which take 20 mins to regenerate which is a lot of time! And it is expensive to purchase offers in the game, so you can only get resources from chests from battles or by participating a war (If you are not purchasing the offers). But after all the cons, the game contains a lot of highly detailed jets and challenges. But I recommend if you are someone who is going to download this game, I assure you that you will have fun (Once you understand how to use the controls) and get a lot of rewards. By far the latest update, there has been a lot of changes by introducing new tier-7 fighter jet, the super reward (It will give you extra coins according to your tier of the plane), the new galactic event which gives you a lot of new paints to your plane and finally the major update which lets you upgrade your plane without any negative upgrades (There has been a lot of complaints about the negative upgrades from the players in the past updates) in the game.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "1"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "2"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1378159422"}, "name": {"label": "naveen babloo"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-05-16T20:24:27-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:version": {"label": "4.2.0"}, "id": {"label": "9934860283"}, "title": {"label": "Game should be based on skill"}, "content": {"label": "People move out of good games when it is driven by more purchases instead of skill. This game is almost like a cat on the wall.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"ter