rough it !! Changed severs , reinsatllation done , wifi switching , SIM card switching everything done but nothing help it out so please do the needful !!! Players name 0450 !!!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "2"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "3"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id488079979"}, "name": {"label": "Spicy SpideR"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-02-12T20:59:06-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "3.8.0"}, "id": {"label": "9612474180"}, "title": {"label": "Tons of bugs"}, "content": {"label": "I am using 200 mbps wifi connection \nand yet whenever i am almost near to win a match it suddenly shows, you have been disconnected. \n\nThe match making is a horrible experience as I am LT and i am being matched with way too higher tiers aircrafts such as Capt., MJ & LCL\n\nThere is simply no chance to defend even after using flares/ chaffs", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1572323748&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1324348508"}, "name": {"label": "lkjijkl"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-02-12T05:41:16-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "3.8.0"}, "id": {"label": "9610203025"}, "title": {"label": "Slots \ud83d\udc7f"}, "content": {"label": "Everything alright but if that slot system removed then everything will be more than Alright", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes